<title>USA: Northern Trust Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.14		    $0.99</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.14		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			 66,500		   58,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,269		   56,686</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	57,421		   58,119</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.27		    $2.74</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$3.25		    $2.71</p>
<p> Net			191,400		  160,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,401		   56,250</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	57,797		   57,771</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>ASSETS: $21.36 billion vs $20.18 billion</p>
<p>LOANS: $10.53 billion vs $9.36 billion</p>
<p>DEPOSITS: $13.44 billion vs $12.47 billion.</p>
<p>Trust fees rose to $147.7 million in the third quarter from $127.3 million a year ago.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
